","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165270458,"discussion_id":"6c2672a786bec33a3caf3d096d50b51a50297b47","body":"/compile","created_at":"2026-03-14T15:51:42+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-14T15:51:42+08:00","user":{"id":"68a4770c49626348fa7fa029","login":"hid54649903","object_id":"68a4770c49626348fa7fa029","name":"zhang-junming21","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/aa/ad/a482aad93ee6a7df064194c83e22353ea06f82b6f0e62d9533b1656a04c03194.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/hid54649903"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165270559,"discussion_id":"e754576e72ae6f8ccba9215fd3ec6a2bbe53095e","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复量化批处理矩阵乘法算子中组大小参数解析错误的问题。在解析编码的组大小参数时，用于提取N和K维度组大小的位偏移和掩码操作存在错误，导致`groupSizeN`和`groupSizeK`的值被错误地赋值，可能影响后续的分块计算逻辑和算子正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n通过交换两行代码中`groupSizeN`和`groupSizeK`的赋值逻辑来修正错误。具体修改为：将原本从`groupSize`中提取`groupSizeK`的位偏移操作（`GROUP_N_OFFSET`）和掩码结果赋值给`groupSizeN`，而将原本从`groupSize`最低位直接提取的掩码结果赋值给`groupSizeK`。这确保了组大小参数在M、N、K三个维度上的正确解析，使其与参数编码的预期语义保持一致。","created_at":"2026-03-14T15:52:31+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-14T15:52:31+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165270571,"discussion_id":"2ee3b862647c26ecc8ff4343e10bb16d0a39633a","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=b582e6c0e2c54a3f8168601c5b292c24&pipelineRunId=09b1911bada34a5eb6017fff3df4d27c&projectName=CANN'>09b1911bada34a5eb6017fff3df4d27c</a></b>]